ze":28044696,"digest":"sha256:564699bcd3c21164a21475bc20503036b340aa7deb5e8d756a78181cbb1e27dd","download_count":1213,"created_at":"2026-09-29T16:01:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T16:01:21Z"},{"id":598670351,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jrvwP","name":"DBX_0.6.28_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":181887240,"digest":"sha256:93a564ceba5c8ba16221185073e2eda1d06d66d6e2785ed4b9c3edd795309c8a","download_count":32,"created_at":"2026-09-29T16:27:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T16:27:23Z"},{"id":598670350,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jrvwO","name":"DBX_0.6.28_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:bff8a925788d8a870a5b0fc2835ec333f5b11ef1ff3fa5581344487f0a746d55","download_count":11,"created_at":"2026-09-29T16:27:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T16:27:19Z"},{"id":598657005,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jrsft","name":"DBX_0.6.28_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":41453942,"digest":"sha256:ffb076e3def8355a86fda98d64f399871db72d2d60457b469c3bc56c61c17c05","download_count":79,"created_at":"2026-09-29T16:20:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T16:20:52Z"},{"id":598613613,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jrh5t","name":"DBX_0.6.28_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":36667392,"digest":"sha256:975cb050041524b02f60740ac34e9c34d72c762ff7d745b831814f65e179cf4e","download_count":77,"created_at":"2026-09-29T16:01:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T16:01:18Z"},{"id":598657098,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jrshK","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":41386737,"digest":"sha256:11de2c0ec8adbf113b5de3d25e7abfe5c2ddfe1fc8b116fa122e3e1b8432e1dc","download_count":57,"created_at":"2026-09-29T16:20:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T16:20:54Z"},{"id":598699169,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jr2yh","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":18797,"digest":"sha256:1865d6536228dd58cf6c2ff76f0d25d954d3dd33a6816c2e2c0132d476dff5f5","download_count":10478,"created_at":"2026-09-29T16:41:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T16:41:00Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n- 新增本地备份导出与恢复，可自选备份内容与导出位置，敏感信息经数据同步密码加密后导出 (contributed by @ma123456mai) (PR [#10578](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10578))\n- 编辑器 Vim 模式支持 ~/.dbx/vimrc 配置文件，可加载常用 Ex 命令并支持 clipboard=unnamedplus 系统剪贴板 (contributed by @TuZaaaaa) (PR [#10646](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10646))\n- 从 Java、Python、JavaScript 等源码复制的字符串拼接 SQL，粘贴进编辑器时自动还原为可直接执行的 SQL (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#10656](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10556))\n- CSV/TSV 导入新增小数分隔符选项，支持 1,23 形式的逗号小数 (contributed by @caichangqing1120) (PR [#10649](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10649))\n- 插件新增 AI 能力接口，可获取供应商与模型列表并调用文本生成，凭据由 DBX 托管、调用前经用户确认 (contributed by @yuwenGueen) (PR [#10629](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10629))\n- 新增 NebulaGraph 3.x 支持，可浏览 space、tag、edge 元数据并执行查询 (contributed by @HandSonic) (PR [#10662](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10662))\n- 虚谷数据库新增可视化用户与权限管理，实例、库、schema、对象与角色权限均可界面配置 (contributed by @mapan0424) (PR [#10610](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10610))\n- StarRocks 表数据网格支持 F2 重命名表 (contributed by @AspBamboo) (PR [#10620](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10620))\n- 侧栏搜索新增「仅搜索已打开的数据库」设置（默认开启），未打开的库不再触发远程加载 (contributed by @jefferyjob) (PR [#10609](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10609))\n- 侧栏连接图标以彩色与灰色表达连接状态，连接情况一目了然 (contributed by @sxhjlzl) (PR [#10594](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10594))\n- MongoDB 补全支持 runCommand 与 createCollection 的选项字段 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#10654](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10654))\n- MongoDB 补全支持操作符子文档与枚举取值 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#10650](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10650))\n- MongoDB 补全支持 use 与 getSiblingDB 之后的数据库名 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#10577](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10577))\n- Web 服务端监听地址可通过 DBX_BIND_ADDR 环境变量配置，可绑定回环地址 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10544](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10544))\n### 改进\n- 网格工具栏「自动刷新」与「跳转到列」控件新增悬停提示 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10605](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10605))\n- 文档 HTML 导出与标注保存移出阻塞执行路径，大文档导出期间其他操作不再被卡住 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10547](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10547))\n### 修复\n- PostgreSQL 表 DDL 保留 serial、smallserial、bigserial 类型别名，不再展开为整数列加 nextval 默认值\n- PostgreSQL 未加引号表标识的网格保存按小写折叠规则处理，编辑结果提交不再报 relation 不存在 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#10593](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10593))\n- MySQL 脚本 DELIMITER 重置命令后无空格也能识别 (contributed by @OOMEcho) (PR [#10579](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10579))\n- SQL Server 存储过程与函数头中声明的参数支持补全 (contributed by @OOMEcho) (PR [#10621](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10621))\n- 数据传输补齐 SQL Server 标识列处理与 SQLite 整型宽度，传输不再报 544 与 248 错误 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10555](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10555))\n- 达梦连接兼容 Java 8 运行时启动，并明确提示该驱动需要 Java 21 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10585](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10585))\n- TDSQL 对象浏览器正常显示表注释 (contributed by @OOMEcho) (PR [#10655](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10655))\n- Doris 表导入单批耗时较长时连接池不再被误判摘除，导入不再中途报 Connection not found for transaction (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10626](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10626))\n- SunDB 连接使用正确的 JDBC 驱动类，连接恢复正常\n- Sybase 表 DDL 查看恢复可用\n- Neo4j 查询保留 :Label 与关系类型写法，不再被当作 :name 模板参数替换 (contributed by @HandSonic) (PR [#10558](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10558))\n- Neo4j Cypher 查询格式化生效，不再无响应\n- MongoDB 数组与嵌套文档单元格按 mongosh 风格显示 ObjectId、日期等 BSON 字面量 (contributed by @onenewcode) (PR [#10571](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10571))\n- MongoDB 键补全落在已有冒号之前时不再产生重复冒号 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#10600](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10600))\n- 网格筛选输入框在值位置不再弹出列名建议，回车应用筛选不再把输入改写成列名 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#10642](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10642))\n- 表结构编辑列名时自动去除首尾空格 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10644](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10644))\n- 编辑连接默认数据库后，已打开的查询标签页同步切换到新库执行 (contributed by @q396921921) (PR [#8051](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/8051))\n- 编辑连接密码框无选中文本时复制，得到的是明文密码而非上一次剪贴板残留 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10536](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10536))\n- macOS 12.1、Chrome 90 等旧内核下界面样式整体失效时给出明确的兼容提示 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10533](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10533))\n- 结构对比最大化弹窗在旧内核 WebView 下保持全屏 (contributed by @wzlstudy) (PR [#10623](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10623))\n- 历史记录面板为筛选区滚动条预留空间，滚动条不再遮挡内容 (contributed by @Rendegou) (PR [#10550](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10550))\n- 可见数据库过滤器「全选」不再保存为当时的库名快照，此后新建的数据库可正常显示 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10664](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10664))\n- 侧栏普通搜索后切换正则模式不再丢失已加载的搜索结果 (contributed by @OOMEcho) (PR [#10566](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10566))\n- 云同步选择性恢复对话框点击确认无反应的问题修复，勾选数据可正常恢复\n- 插件中心布局按面板实际宽度自适应，分栏或侧栏内打开时筛选栏不再溢出 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#10624](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10624))\n- 插件批量更新失败的红色横幅随插件状态变化消失，不再与「已是最新」提示矛盾共存 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#10591](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10591))\n- 插件文件访问授权改由 Rust 侧确认，渲染进程路径不再直接放行 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10538](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10538))\n- 外部 MCP 服务器的插件工具遵循只读策略与会话范围限制，越权调用被拒绝 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10537](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10537))\n- MCP 工具允许列表支持插件工具通配符，dbx_<前缀>__* 暴露单个插件、dbx_*__* 暴露全部插件工具 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10546](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10546))\n- Windows 下 MCP 可执行文件路径统一为原生格式，dbx-mcp.exe 启动失败修复\n- AI 输入区控件恢复按宽度渐进收纳，模型选择器与模式控件分级显示、不再整体消失\n- Web 服务端 Redis 发布订阅 WebSocket 升级校验同源，跨站连接被拒绝 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10545](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10545))\n- Web 服务端修改密码对全部在线会话生效，认证请求体大小受限 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10540](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10540))\n- Web 服务端安装未签名插件需显式配置开启，默认拒绝 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10541](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10541))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.28) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.28` 拉取。\n","reactions":{"total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":20}
